  Features omitted:      edge-chamfer (not modelled by this builder); under-head-radius (ISO 4762 does not give a verified under-head radius for this builder; a typed omission rather than a guessed fillet); thread (no thread geometry at this detail level); bore-edge-chamfer (not modelled by this builder); thread-runout (not modelled by this builder)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
